Copyright Convai Innovations, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The Laya multilingual checkpoint uses the jhu-clsp/mmBERT-base encoder.
Its license statement is the MIT declaration in the Hugging Face model
card metadata and README (commit c5955035435e) and in the README of
github.com/JHU-CLSP/mmBERT; neither repository ships a LICENSE file or
names a copyright holder (checked 2026-10-17). The model is described in
"mmBERT: A Modern Multilingual Encoder with Annealed Language Learning"
(Marone, Weller, Fleshman, Yang, Lawrie, Van Durme, 2025).
